## Verify

1. `dotnet build client/Runewake.Client.csproj -c Debug` — paste raw errors if any.
   **Three new files** (`TitleAtmosphere.cs`, `MenuButtons.cs`, `build_music.py`)
   and three inline GLSL shaders that I could not compile here. If a shader fails
   it logs at runtime rather than at build, so also check the log in step 3 for
   any line containing `shader`.

2. Godot will generate `.import` files for the three new .ogg on first open. That
   is expected; commit them.

3. Title screen, first thing to look at:
   ```bash
